  "title": "What Is API Generation? How APIs Get Built for Any Platform",
  "summary": "API generation creates programmatic access to web platforms that have no public API, by reverse-engineering the private HTTP endpoints the platform's own frontend calls. The result is a documented, stable API you can call like any REST endpoint.",
